name ppr-prv
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Prosper preview
relocated 1
longdesc This class is used with LaTeX presentations using the prosper
longdesc class. ppr-prv stands for 'Prosper Preview'. The aim of this
longdesc class is to produce a printable version of the slides written
longdesc with Prosper, with two slides per page.
runfiles size=7
